--- a/test_ops_status.md
+++ b/test_ops_status.md
@@ -1322,3 +1322,37 @@ exact base/exponent-sign masks handle the fixed-seed fp16 boundaries.
 Non-official random seeds still expose the broader fp16-versus-float32
